invariant: INV-13
file: quic_fail.c
catches: quic_driver_test
reason: quic_fail keeps the alert for ch_quic_alert and no longer records it
  for ch_alert_sent, so the two calls disagree on a failed QUIC session.
  bin/quic_driver_test requires ch_alert_sent to answer what ch_quic_alert
  answers.

--- old
    q->t.alert_sent = q->alert;
--- new
